# Local IPOs: Economy → Investments shows the local company cards below the game's stocks: a
# section label, one card per kind of business the city has (its line and its bar), and a line
# summing up the board. With the flag off they are gone. Reads only; the flag is put back.
name local ipos: the Investments tab shows a card per kind of business, and none with the flag off
# the game's own Investments lists, whatever the "Investments list and research" flag says
investments-list off
local-ipos on
ipo-scan
show-economy
wait 1.5
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulCompanyCardSection
expect-text FinanceOverhaulCompanyCardSectionText Local companies
expect-company-cards
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulCompanyCardFooter
expect-text FinanceOverhaulCompanyCardFooterText Local listings
# they sit after the game's stocks: scroll to the end to see them
scroll-bottom InvestmentsScrollablePanel
wait 0.5
expect-in-view FinanceOverhaulCompanyCardFooter InvestmentsScrollablePanel
capture ipo-cards
local-ipos off
wait 1.5
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulCompanyCardSection
cleanup:
investments-list restore
close-economy
local-ipos restore
